\par
This is local-first personal AI. Runs on your device. Private by default.\par
No data leaves your device unless you configure cloud engines.\par
\par
Features:\par
- Iron Man HUD interface\par
- ADHD Co-Pilot with 16 tools\par
- 47 tools total, 11 agents\par
- Autostart + Good Morning Eugene + Task Alignment\par
- Body Double + 3D Arc Reactor + Voice Cloning + Face Recognition\par
- Website Blocker + Focus Sounds + Hyperfocus Guard\par
- Calendar + Gmail real OAuth\par
- vLLM/MLX/FAISS/Tavily/DDGS support\par
